Hello everyone,

Just joined the list.  I am planning on building a mesh network for 7,000
clients utilizing 145 gateways.  I have the radio backbone already in place
for another purpose (145 stations connected to centrally located tower) and
this is fed by fiber.

I am interested in mesh since some clients (indoor dual-band routers) will
not be able to communicate directly with the 145 radios.

I plan to add a second radio at each of the 145 sites to be part of the mesh
network.

Any help or suggestions will be appreciated.

